### Home HTML
GET http://localhost:8000/

### Health JSON
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Supplies list
GET http://localhost:8000/supplies

### Create supply form
GET http://localhost:8000/supplies/create

### Submit supply form
POST http://localhost:8000/supplies
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Surgical Mask&group=Personal Protection&supplier=MedCare Vietnam&unit_price=85000&quantity=20

### Login form
GET http://localhost:8000/login

### Login submit
POST http://localhost:8000/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=student@example.com&password=123456

### Redirect
GET http://localhost:8000/go-home

### 404
GET http://localhost:8000/unknown

### 405
POST http://localhost:8000/health
